    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Tale of Driftwood</i> is a visual novel where readers follow the perspective of the protagonist, Zhi An, to unravel the mystery behind a mysterious bracelet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game contains elements such as BL (boys' love), BG (boys and girls' love), NTR (netorare, or romantic betrayal), and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Number of Endings:</strong><br>There are two endings in total. The first ending can be achieved in the first playthrough, while the second ending is unlocked only during the second playthrough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Length:</strong><br>A complete playthrough of both routes takes approximately 2 hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy complex emotional stories and interactive narratives, <i>The Tale of Driftwood</i> offers a compact yet engaging experience!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Tale of Driftwood</i> is a visual novel where readers follow the perspective of the protagonist, Zhi An, to unravel the mystery behind a mysterious bracelet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game contains elements such as BL (boys' love), BG (boys and girls' love), NTR (netorare, or romantic betrayal), and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Number of Endings:</strong><br>There are two endings in total. The first ending can be achieved in the first playthrough, while the second ending is unlocked only during the second playthrough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Length:</strong><br>A complete playthrough of both routes takes approximately 2 hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy complex emotional stories and interactive narratives, <i>The Tale of Driftwood</i> offers a compact yet engaging experience!</p>",
    "short_description": "A mysterious bracelet, familiar dreams, and Zhi An, a male college student who just got a girlfriend, now faces a sudden appearance of a lover (male) from his past life. How should he choose? What is the hidden abnormality beneath the surface of everyday life?",
